      "color": "orange",
      "text": "Springboard. An iPhone home screen for the site: widgets of mixed sizes, coloured app icons, a frosted dock.\n\nLayout: 8-column widget grid (small, medium, large tiles), large iOS titles, grouped lists for tables and settings.\nThe memorable thing: Each page is an app with its own Apple system colour; the home screen is a grid of live widgets.\nType: Figtree 800 for large titles and widget numbers; 500–700 for text and lists.\nLight: bg #F2F2F7, surf #FFFFFF, ink #1C1C1E, muted #6C6C72, acc #FF9500, line #D8D8DE\nDark: bg #000000, surf #1C1C1E, ink #F5F5F7, muted #98989F, acc #FF9F0A, line #38383A\nMagnet rail on the right edge. Live prices on these boards are NSE closing prices from 25 Sep 2026; every chart is drawn from real data or the project's pricer."
    }
